Crab artwork notice: the pixel crab (Clawd) is a character of Anthropic, and
all rights in it remain with Anthropic. `crab-laptop-body.png` and
`crab-laptop-ink.png` are frames of Claude Code's own animation; the remaining
sheets in this directory are drawn by the DSH project after that character (by
`scripts/draw-crab.py`). These files are **not** covered by the MIT license of
the DSH project. DSH is an unofficial fan work, not affiliated with or endorsed
by Anthropic.

Copied for a personal, unofficial fan app. See docs/research/06-dsh-ux-spec.md
§4 and docs/research/08-dsh-live-observation.md §7 for the provenance.
